.TH TIHO 1 "November 2026" "Tiho Desktop" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tiho \- launch the Tiho desktop browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tiho
.RI [ Firefox options ] " " [ URL ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches the bundled Firefox ESR with the Tiho desktop start page and the user's dedicated Tiho profile.
.SH PROFILES
The default profile is stored in
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tiho/profile
or
.I ~/.config/tiho/profile
when XDG_CONFIG_HOME is unset.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tiho-bank (1),
.BR tiho-private (1),
.BR firefox (1)
